{
  "title": "When the Unknown Thrums",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mbox stub\" style=\"border-left-width:8px;margin-bottom:5px;border-left-color:#d6d6d6;position:relative;display:flex;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid #d6d6d6;min-height:32px\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\" style=\"display:table;padding:8px 15px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;image mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-mbox\" style=\"text-align:center;padding-right:15px;display:table-cell;height:100%;vertical-align:middle;width:40px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e8/Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png/revision/latest?cb=20240703174053\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Baizhi Sticker Slice of Life 01 08\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e8/Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/65?cb=20240703174053\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Baizhi Sticker Slice of Life 01 08.png\" data-image-key=\"Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\" style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\" style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">This <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_Stubs\" title=\"Category:Article Stubs\">page</a> is in need of information.</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-mbox\" style=\"display:block\">Can you help out? <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/When_the_Unknown_Thrums?action=edit\">Click here to add more.</a><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text&#95;&#95;comment\" style=\"font-size:small\">summary</div></div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-mbox\" title=\"Dismiss\" style=\"color:#bbb;right:0;cursor:pointer;font-size:16px;top:0;transition:all .15s ease-in;position:absolute;padding:2px 7px;font-weight:bold\"></span></div></div></div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">When the Unknown Thrums</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/fd/Lahai-Roi.png/revision/latest?cb=20251226025508\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Quest When the Unknown Thrums\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/fd/Lahai-Roi.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20251226025508\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/fd/Lahai-Roi.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20251226025508 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/fd/Lahai-Roi.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20251226025508 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Quest When the Unknown Thrums\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Quest_When_the_Unknown_Thrums.png\" data-image-name=\"Quest When the Unknown Thrums.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Main_Quests\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Main Quests\">Main</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"chapter\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Chapter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chapter_III\" title=\"Chapter III\">Chapter III</a>: Prologue</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Description</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The gateway to Lahai-Roi is now open! What burns beneath the frostlands is waiting for your return!</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\">Previous Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flowing_Starlight_in_the_Iris\" title=\"Flowing Starlight in the Iris\">Flowing Starlight in the Iris</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/What_Burns_Beneath_Frostlands\" title=\"What Burns Beneath Frostlands\">What Burns Beneath Frostlands</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCharacters\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"characters\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aemeath\" title=\"Aemeath\">Aemeath</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Chisa\" title=\"Chisa\">Chisa</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Lynae\" title=\"Lynae\">Lynae</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Namipon\" title=\"Namipon\">Namipon</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rover\" title=\"Rover\">Rover</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Shorekeeper\" title=\"Shorekeeper\">Shorekeeper</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>When the Unknown Thrums</b> is the prologue act in <a href=\"/wiki/Chapter_III\" title=\"Chapter III\">Chapter III</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Quest\" title=\"Main Quest\">Main Quest</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Steps\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Summary\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Summary</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Navigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li>Leave Honami City and wait for the Shorekeeper's reply</li>\n<li>Head to the rift in the Black Shores and enter Honami City</li>\n<li>Talk to Shorekeeper</li>\n<li>Follow Shorekeeper to the spatial tunnel</li>\n<li>Next Stop: Lahai-Roi</li>\n<li>Shake off the pursuing Voidworm</li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Summary\">Summary</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-content\">You finally receive a reply from Shorekeeper regarding the stabilization of the spatial tunnel to Lahai-Roi and tells you to meet with her at Shasho Cafe once ready.<br /><br />Shorekeeper briefs you on Lahai-Roi. It's a region without a Sentinel to guide its civilization, and your frequency loss may be tied to a Threnodian-induced Waveworn Phenomenon known as the Void Storm. She explains that the Spacetrek Collective leads the world in frequency-stabilization research, and you might find a solution to your problem there. Before you depart, she hands you an acceptance letter. This time around, you'll be entering Startorch Academy as a student.<br /><br />The spatial tunnel to Lahai-Roi allows only one person to pass through at a time. After thanking Namipon and Shorekeeper, Chisa goes first. You bid Shorekeeper farewell and leave under her watchful gaze.<br /><br />You enter the rift, wandering through the dark void to suddenly have a body resembling you fall from above onto the ground. It suddenly unravels and grabs ahold of you, absorbing your frequency as you are faced against a giant black hole resembling an eye. You are then saved by a flash of pink light, revealing a girl doned in a white suit. After she playfully tap your nose and leaves, you watch the dark void become filled with stars.<br /><br />An unknown girl shoots a researcher in red, walking away from the scene to her motorcycle. Falling through the rift, you finally make it out safely to only be struck by the girl earlier. She apologizes and offers to take you to the infirmary to check for injury, however, your meeting was interrupted by a storm, led by a giant Void Worm that gives chase.<br />Working together, you bring down falling rocks to slow the creature and make your escape.<br /><br />Together on the motorcycle, the two of you bursts out of the cave into the vast, open view of Lahai-Roi. The girl introduces herself as Lynae, and together, you continue toward Startorch Academy.</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dt>You finally receive a reply from Shorekeeper regarding the stabilization of the spatial tunnel to Lahai-Roi and tells you to meet with her at Shasho Cafe once ready.</dt></dl>\n<dl><dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;), how are you feeling?</dd>\n<dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> The spatial tunnel to Lahai-Roi has stabilized. You may depart whenever you're ready.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> Meet me at the Shashou Cafe once you've made all necessary preparations.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> I will be here, waiting.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>Shorekeeper briefs you on Lahai-Roi. It's a region without a Sentinel to guide its civilization, and your frequency loss may be tied to a Threnodian-induced Waveworn Phenomenon known as the Void Storm. She explains that the Spacetrek Collective leads the world in frequency-stabilization research, and you might find a solution to your problem there. Before you depart, she hands you an acceptance letter. This time around, you'll be entering Startorch Academy as a student.</dt></dl>\n<dl><dt><b>Talk to Shorekeeper</b></dt>\n<dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;), you have come.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> I can go to Lahai-Roi now?</dd>\n<dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> Yes. Thanks to Namipon's efforts, the Black Shores has confirmed Lahai-Roi's relative coordinates to Honami City and stabilized a one-way tunnel.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> You may set out whenever you wish.</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> What is it?</dd>\n<dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> This? Chisa taught me how to make this beverage. I find it tastes better with more milk and sugar...</dd>\n<dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> I just made a cup. Would you... like to try it?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> ...Why not?\n<dl><dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> Hm, very well.</dd>\n<dd>(The aroma is rich, but it doesn't taste like coffee at all.)</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> Were you worried about something just now?</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> I meant that you looked troubled.\n<dl><dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> Yes.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> Your frequency still fluctuates. It's barely detectable, but... enough to concern me.</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> About Lahai-Roi, the current Void Storm is lasting longer than usual.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> This is an uncommon state, and for now, the Black Shores can glean little else from what lies beyond the rift.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Do you think something's happened there?</dd>\n<dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> Unlike other regions on Solaris, Lahai-Roi has no Sentinel to guide its civilization. Once considered naught but a forsaken frostland, it remained hidden until the Spacetrek Collective, an international research organization, discovered it.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> Yet the Threnodian has always lurked in the shadows of this frostland, causing Waveworn Phenomena such as the Void Storm.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> Exposure to a Void Storm drains human frequencies until they vanish. I suspect that your own frequency loss is linked to this abnormal Storm cycle.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> The Spacetrek Collective is at the forefront of frequency-stabilization research. Once there, you will undergo a full examination and receive treatment.</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> So the source of the problem and its solution can only be found there.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> Yes. The way to Lahai-Roi is open. It's time for you to return.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> This is...</dd>\n<dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> The paperwork for entry into Startorch Academy. Access to Lahai-Roi requires strict clearance, so the Black Shores arranged for you to enter as a \"student.\"</dd>\n<dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> This acceptance letter belonged to your past self. It's still valid and will grant you access. Please keep it safe.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Thank you for preparing all this.</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> So this trip's theme is \"Back to School,\" huh?</dd>\n<dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> Once you enter Lahai-Roi, I won't be able to contact you, but I will be here as always, awaiting your return with new stories to share.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Don't worry. Everything will go fine.\n<dl><dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> Yes... Take care of yourself.</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Maybe I'll find a way to teleport back to you.\n<dl><dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> Hmm...? If only that were true.</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><b>Chisa:</b> My apologies. I'm late.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> It's time to set out.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt><b>Follow Shorekeeper to the spatial tunnel</b></dt>\n<dd><b>Chisa:</b> (Heavy Breathing)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> We  don't need to rush into this.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Are you alright?</dd>\n<dd><b>Chisa:</b> Mm-hmm... Yawn...</dd>\n<dd><b>Chisa:</b> It's just... thinking about going back to the Academy kept me up all night.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Is it nerves or excitement?\n<dl><dd><b>Chisa:</b> Both, I guess. It's been two decades since I was last there. I wonder how the Academy looks now. My teachers, classmates, and my parents...</dd>\n<dd><b>Chisa:</b> No. I can't waver before setting out.</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> I get it. Same here.\n<dl><dd><b>Chisa:</b> You too? Yes... I can imagine.</dd>\n<dd><b>Chisa:</b> (Exhales) Never mind. Whatever happens, I'll face it head-on. You taught me that, remember? That means you should relax too.</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>The spatial tunnel to Lahai-Roi allows only one person to pass through at a time. After thanking Namipon and Shorekeeper, Chisa goes first. You bid Shorekeeper farewell and leave under her watchful gaze.</dt></dl>\n<dl><dd><b>Namipon:</b> Oh my, oh my, the day's finally here.</dd>\n<dd><b>Namipon:</b> The coordinates have all been calibrated. A smooth landing, guaranteed!</dd>\n<dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> The tunnel is stable, but only wide enough for one person at a time.</dd>\n<dd><b>Chisa:</b> I see. Then please let me go first.</dd>\n<dd><b>Chisa:</b> Namipon, Shorekeeper... thank you. For looking after me during this time.</dd>\n<dd><b>Namipon:</b> Oh, don't get all serious! You can visit during your holidays.</dd>\n<dd><b>Chisa:</b> ...Alright. I promise I'll visit often.</dd>\n<dd><b>Chisa:</b> Well then, (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;), I'll see you at the Academy.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> See you there.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> The tunnel is stable. She'll arrive safely.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> I'm ready too.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> You are fully prepared. I see.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shorekeeper:</b> (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;), safe journey.</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> Alright. Time to go.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>You enter the rift, wandering through the dark void to suddenly have a body resembling you fall from above onto the ground. It suddenly unravels and grabs ahold of you, absorbing your frequency as you are faced against a giant black hole resembling an eye. You are then saved by a flash of pink light, revealing a girl doned in a white suit. After she playfully tap your nose and leaves, you watch the dark void become filled with stars.</dt></dl>\n<dl><dd><b>Rover:</b> (My frequency...)</dd>\n<dd><b><a href=\"/wiki/Aemeath\" title=\"Aemeath\">???</a>:</b> Journey well.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>An unknown girl shoots a researcher in red, walking away from the scene to her motorcycle. Falling through the rift, you finally make it out safely to only be struck by the girl earlier. She apologizes and offers to take you to the infirmary to check for injury, however, your meeting was interrupted by a storm, led by a giant Void Worm that gives chase.</dt>\n<dt>Working together, you bring down falling rocks to slow the creature and make your escape.</dt></dl>\n<dl><dd><b><a href=\"/wiki/Lynae\" title=\"Lynae\">???</a></b> Oh my gosh! I'm so, so sorry!</dd>\n<dd><b>???</b> You okay?</dd>\n<dd><b>???</b> Hurt anywhere?</dd>\n<dd><b>???</b> You're a Startorch Academy student too, right? Come on, I'll get you to the infirmary—</dd>\n<dd><b>???</b> It's a Voidworm. We gotta get out of here!</dd>\n<dd><b>???</b> Hold tight.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt><b>Shake off the pursuing Voidworm</b></dt>\n<dd><b><a href=\"/wiki/Lynae\" title=\"Lynae\">???</a></b> You okay back there? Sorry... I didn't see you. I'll handle this.</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> I'm fine. But this Voidworm is carrying the Threnodian's frequency...</dd>\n<dd><b>???</b> Huh? How do you know that? Never mind, I know a few tricks to shake it off.</dd>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> (Sniff sniff. It's that guy!)</dd>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> (It stole your frequency! I'd know that stink anywhere!)</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> (Now isn't a good time for a face-off. We'll settle the score later, Abby.)</dd>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> (Fine, but it's not getting off easy!)</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> So this is what everyone here fights against.</dd>\n<dd><b>???</b> The Academy's got a defensive barrier for the Void Storm. Once we're there, we're safe!</dd>\n<dd><b>???</b> Darn it. It's charging up. Hang tight!</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> Careful! It's closing in from the back.</dd>\n<dd><b>???</b> Got it. Hang on. Full throttle!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dd><b>???</b> Need a place to use the terrain against it.</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> What about over there?</dd>\n<dd><b>???</b> Hah, easy! Leave it to me.</dd>\n<dd><b>???</b> Perfect! Let's go!</dd>\n<dd><b>???</b> Phew... Safe and sound!</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> Is that building over there...</dd>\n<dd><b>???</b> Hm? Oh, that's Startorch Academy, where we're heading. Pretty amazing, huh?</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> It's... far beyond what I had imagined.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lynae:</b> Didn't get to introduce myself. I'm Lynae, by the way.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lynae:</b> I saw your acceptance letter, so... freshman? What's your name?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;).</dd>\n<dd><b>Lynae:</b> Oh okay, (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;)... I got it.</dd>\n<dd><b>Lynae:</b> It's not totally safe yet. Let's keep moving while we talk.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>Together on the motorcycle, the two of you bursts out of the cave into the vast, open view of Lahai-Roi. The girl introduces herself as Lynae, and together, you continue toward Startorch Academy.</dt>\n<dt><b>(Quest Complete)</b></dt></dl>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table alternating-colors-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji EN Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji EN Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_EN_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f5/Emoji_EN_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221541\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;English</b></td><td>When the Unknown Thrums</td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\"><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ZHS Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ZHS Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/5f/Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221618\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Chinese <abbr title=\"Simplified\"><small>(S)</small></abbr></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">未知的既感</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\"><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ZHT Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ZHT Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ZHT_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/02/Emoji_ZHT_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221733\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Chinese <abbr title=\"Traditional\"><small>(T)</small></abbr></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">未知的既感</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji JA Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji JA Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_JA_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/8/84/Emoji_JA_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221804\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">未知の予感</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji KO Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji KO Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_KO_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/5d/Emoji_KO_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221837\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">알</span> <span lang=\"ko\">수</span> <span lang=\"ko\">없는</span> <span lang=\"ko\">예감</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji FR Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji FR Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_FR_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/c/c6/Emoji_FR_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221935\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;French</b></td><td>Quand l'inconnu palpite</td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji DE Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji DE Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_DE_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/3/3b/Emoji_DE_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221959\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;German</b></td><td>Wenn das Unbekannte pulst</td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ES Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ES Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ES_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d2/Emoji_ES_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221908\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Spanish</b></td><td>Cuando resuena lo desconocido</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"change-history\"><div class=\"change-history-header\"><div>Released in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Version/3.0\" title=\"Version/3.0\">Version 3.0</a></b></div><div>[<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/When_the_Unknown_Thrums/Change_History?action=edit&amp;preload=Template:Change_History/Preload&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=3.0&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=When+the+Unknown+Thrums\">Create New History</a>]</div></div></div><div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Navigation\">Navigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"navbox-border navbox\" style=\"border-spacing:0;;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:2px;\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" cl